  "introMissionTitle": "Our team of experts  brings the success of the clinical program to you!",
  "introMissionAndrew": "Andrew has a PHD in Bio-Chemistry and is the brains behind our nutrition program. With curated recipes, customized goals, and NO FOCUS ON CALORIE TRACKING, our nutrition program is one-of-a-kind.",
