  "introMissionShalu": "Shalu is an MD specialized in Psychiatry. With her focus on addiction and addictive-behaviors, she is intrinsically qualified to oversee and encourage your journey to happier, healthier lifestyle.",
  "introMissionJoshua": "With a love for sports and the human body, Josh has a Sports Science degree and years of experience as a physiotherapist focusing on weight loss. He's great at helping people move better and feel their best.",
  "introMissionDenise": "Denise is an experienced clinical psychologist, who is also trained in Cognitive Behaviour Therapy, Meditation, and Mindfulness Based Therapy. Her passion is to give people the courage to change, and to guide them through the process step-by step.",
